// Regression test: empty source file.
//
// An empty program should compile and execute without producing output
// or triggering sanitizer errors.

// BUG FIX
// This test exposed undefined behavior caused by an ODR violation.
// Both vm.h and compiler.cpp defined a globally scoped class named
// `Scope`, but their definitions had incompatible layouts.
// This led to incorrect destruction of objects in the VM's scope vector.
//
// FIX
// Renamed the VM's type to `VMScope` to give the two types distinct names.

// FUTURE
// Consider using namespaces to separate compiler and VM implementation
// details and reduce the risk of name collisions.
